  "_Pdwzodp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1833658219": "Specifies the unique identification of an account as assigned by the account servicer.",
  "_Pea6ETq5EeWyoP0PbocV1Q": "Choice of format for the acknowledgement reason.",
  "_PgJZVdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1129957204": "Unique identification, as assigned by the original instructing party, to unambiguously identify the message.",
  "_PrnlsWkJEeS7zPBpvm732w": "Parameters associated to the MAC algorithm.",
  "_Q-UncNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_458279675": "Choice between an amount or a rate.",
  "_Q1Ld4XR1EeiH1ZOt2UD8vQ": "Information about a document.",
  "_Q2IvxXhdEeidzqjNEfehPg": "Specifies the error resulting from the processing of a request.",
  "_Q65gBdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-21330104": "Number used to sequence pages when it is not possible for data to be conveyed in a single message and the data has to be split across several pages (messages).",
  "_Q6vvAdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_2101402955": "References a related message or provides another reference, such as a pool reference, linking a set of messages. The party which issued the related reference may be the Sender of the referenced message or a party other than the Sender.",
  "_Q6vvBdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-2133276556": "Choice between the specification of the data in a structured or unstructured form.",
  "_Q6vvCNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1503007069": "Additional information that can not be captured in the structured fields and/or any other specific block.",
  "_Q7Vk6Np-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_934154443": "Sort criteria.",
  "_Q7fV4dp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_321425004": "Set of elements providing the total sum of entries.",
  "_Q7mCEQasEeSrXeb3pHPmbg": "Scope|A report provider, such as a transfer agent, sends the FundConfirmedCashForecastReportCancellation message to the report user, such as an investment manager or pricing agent, to cancel a previously sent FundConfirmedCashForecastReport message.|Usage|The FundConfirmedCashForecastReportCancellation message is used to cancel an entire FundConfirmedCashForecastReport message that was previously sent by the report provider. This message must contain reference to the of the message being cancelled.|This message may also contain details of the message to be cancelled, but this is not recommended.",
  "_Q7pG5Np-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-967008570": "Identifies a message by a unique identifier and the date and time when the message was created by the sender.",
  "_Q8Ps0a6AEeexrtTFgmVD3Q": "Choice between a date or a date and time format for a period.",
  "_Q8jO0QdxEeSPHJIdUs1USg": "Information about a cash forecast report.",
  "_QACaQtp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_362604391": "Sets of elements to identify a name of the organisation identification scheme.",
  "_QACaRdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-322320404": "Information related to an identification of an organisation.",
  "_QALkM9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-2141717394": "Information related to an identification of a financial institution.",
  "_QALkMNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-2021925461": "Sets of elements to identify a name of the organisation identification scheme.",
  "_QALkN9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1748202225": "Information related to an identification, for example party identification or account identification.",
  "_QFsWVdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1040515995": "Information supplied to enable the matching of an entry with the items that the transfer is intended to settle.",
  "_QG4pJdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1972571676": "Information that locates and identifies a specific address, as defined by postal services.",
  "_QG4pKNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-839174134": "Information that locates and identifies a specific address, as defined by postal services.",
  "_QGckRNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_829983721": "Address of a party expressed in a formal structure, usually according to the country's postal services specifications.",
  "_QIYeB9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-498720410": "Information on the occurred settlement time(s) of the payment transaction.",
  "_QIrY6dp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_2050617089": "Provides information on the requested settlement time(s) of the payment instruction.",
  "_QJa_zNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1912716963": "Specifies the service level of the transaction.",
  "_QKoAqdEdEei798TPbKJMuw": "Reason for the status of the payment transaction.",
  "_QOIUkXhdEeidzqjNEfehPg": "It is used to provide some or all of the members with information related to the processing of the system.",
  "_QRBcl9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1721645359": "Choice of identification of a party.",
