  "_0eBEq6ayEe-s1ZClExRjdw": "ISO track 2 issued from the magnetic stripe card or from the ICC if the magnetic stripe was not read. The content is conform to ISO 7813, removing beginning and ending sentinels and longitudinal redundancy check characters.",
