  "_Qd1wktp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-722284713": "Identifier for French securities assigned by the Societe Interprofessionnelle Pour La Compensation des Valeurs Mobilieres in France. The Sicovam is composed of 5-digits.",
  "_Qd1wlNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1064399423": "Identifier of securities issued in Luxembourg. The common code is a 9-digit code that replaces the CEDEL (Clearstream) and Euroclear codes.",
